  "content": "\n\n<p>如需本模組的資料包版本，請前往 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252ffarmers-cutting-regions-unexplored\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</p>\n<p>為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/regions-unexplored\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Regions Unexplored</a> 新增更多 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> 砧板配方</p>\n<ul>\n<li>針對所有（適用）木材類型提供剝皮、刮除與回收功能</li>\n<li>從可產出顏料的植物中獲取更多顏料</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/regions_unexplored/media/woodcutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"木材加工\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/regions_unexplored/media/floracutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"花卉加工\"></p>\n<p>想要將 Farmer's Cutting 的所有內容整合為單一模組嗎？請查看 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-cutting-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Cutting Collection</a>！</p>",
